### 1. 成功创建失物 (正常)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/lost-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "itemName": "水杯",
  "feature": "底部有贴纸"
}

### 2. 触发规则报错 (特征为空)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/lost-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "itemName": "笔袋",
  "feature": ""
}

### 3. 查询全部失物
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lost-items

### 4. 根据ID查询 (假设上面创建成功获取了ID为1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lost-items/1
